<title>USA: Yields on Bond Buyer's weekly indices idle.</title>
<headline>Yields on Bond Buyer's weekly indices idle.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices were virtually unchanged this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.72 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.62 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.00 percent, down one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.72%   5.72%  1/23/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.62%   5.62%  1/23/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.00%   6.01%  1/23/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
